<thead class="bg-gray-100">

<tr><th class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-left">端点</th><th class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-left">模型</th><th class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-left">输出维度</th><th class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-left">上下文</th><th class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-left">每百万 token 价格</th><th class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-left">用途</th></tr>

</thead>

<tbody>

<tr><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2"><strong>jina-embeddings-v3</strong></td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">v3（570M）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">32-1024（Matryoshka）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">8192</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">$0.02</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">生产 RAG（默认）</td></tr>

<tr><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2"><strong>jina-embeddings-v2-base-en</strong></td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">v2 英文（137M）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">768</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">8192</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">$0.02</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">纯英文 RAG（开源，Apache 2.0）</td></tr>

<tr><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2"><strong>jina-embeddings-v2-base-de</strong></td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">v2 德文（137M）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">768</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">8192</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">$0.02</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">纯德文 RAG（开源，Apache 2.0）</td></tr>

<tr><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2"><strong>jina-embeddings-v2-base-zh</strong></td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">v2 中文（137M）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">768</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">8192</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">$0.02</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">纯中文 RAG（开源，Apache 2.0）</td></tr>

<tr><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2"><strong>jina-embeddings-v2-base-code</strong></td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">v2 代码（137M）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">768</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">8192</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">$0.02</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">代码搜索 RAG（开源，Apache 2.0）</td></tr>

<tr><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2"><strong>jina-clip-v1</strong></td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">CLIP-v1（446M）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">768</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">text 512 / image 1024</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">$0.02</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">文本-图像跨模态检索</td></tr>

<tr><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2"><strong>jina-reranker-v3</strong></td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">v3（550M）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">score</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">8192</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">$0.018</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">多语言重排序（100+ 语言）</td></tr>

<tr><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2"><strong>jina-reranker-v2-base-multilingual</strong></td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">v2 multilingual（278M）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">score</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">8192</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">$0.018</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">多语言重排序（遗留，开源）</td></tr>

<tr><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2"><strong>Reader</strong></td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">Reader v0.5（URL 抓取）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">干净 Markdown</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">URL 内容</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">$0.02（每月 1M 免费）</td><td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">URL → 干净 Markdown，用于 RAG 数据采集</td></tr>

